# The Goblin Tailor (jeuno 42): 10016 open, the quest set accepted by a GM: the finish finds no 10016 handler in the
# accepted / completed state (begin not repeated).
lists LowerJeuno/Guttrix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10016
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-34.5,5.5,-139.7 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 250
login
trigger Guttrix                         # available: 10016 (1, 1)
quest Jeuno.TheGoblinTailor available   # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGoblinTailor accepted    # a GM, while 10016 is open
finish                                  # no 10016 finish while accepted: nothing
